# Parallel verticals

KoreaPlus in this repo is three products, usually edited in **separate Cursor chats**:

| Lane | Live | Isolated deploy |
|------|------|-----------------|
| K-Beauty | `/kbeauty` | `.\deploy-kbeauty-app.ps1` (+ `bash deploy-kbeauty.sh` for `kb/`) |
| K-Pop | `/kpop` | `.\deploy-kpop.ps1` |
| Guide | `/guide/` | `.\deploy-to-guide.ps1` is the **full tree** |

Shared Worker (`koreaplus-webapp.jeybeeicon.workers.dev`): `.\deploy-worker.ps1` or `npm run deploy`. Unsets a stray `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` so deploys stay on the jeybeeicon account.

`.\deploy-to-guide.ps1` uploads the working tree, including uncommitted files from other chats. Use it only when the user asks for a full Guide deploy and you have confirmed the other lanes are safe.

Stay inside the lane of the current chat unless the user explicitly asks to cross.
